\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><rect width=\"907.1\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>"}]}